      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "summary",
          "text": "A denial-of-service vulnerability exists in the affected Logix platforms due to improper validation of input length during CIP message processing. This can result in a major nonrecoverable fault (MNRF), requiring a power cycle to recover.",
